  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "dadae4df-9343-457d-b4b7-4aaea6625900",
      "title": "Leia o contexto curto antes de entrar nas palavras da aula.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "bf34ca43-da19-4e90-a799-545f4b9c7205",
          "textContent": "<p>Imagine um deslocamento simples pela cidade: sair do hotel, passar pelo centro e chegar a um museu.</p><p>Nesta aula, o foco é reconhecer palavras úteis para escolher o transporte, entender pontos da rota e falar do bilhete da viagem.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ceeaa09b-c6ae-4e56-bdf7-848035b4d575",
      "title": "Olhe a imagem, escute o áudio e observe a palavra em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "38cd76ce-7da7-4944-a6a8-570b0b5aa8fc",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe, escute e leia.</p><p><strong>el metro</strong></p><p>Em português: o metrô.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8526a02edee441019e36fc876a6c4446_b02-el-metro.png?Expires=1794099612&Signature=sPJy9cSvU424CKkT9RV4rvGRPU8VBbj0EMZasdw5KsENfkANg7ptHARvUTtxsEvNzloSvveR6OfHbqeyCl-KtjLPByL3P~qBF0vD5KFvLoqdicpo7zv0wML4dOJPwrqWngjARnSkAgkWmSkmDzbNIiBTb5I54qmw6nk88~QpGhUdMaC0gyRqA~FTn787ZcPdY0ycUyj98Hb4OOOv~UVv2dVqlY80PRJApnCysSKL3Sacd8cPc5jBi79UrK3ETuSjncy78TDrPj04L3n~RNx-Wk1~O4-aEnZJSFn3LDD4HgSp-t~RNVm-gJkL0XADn5HyUBBMShnAk7FtK9UrGFjCAQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/788ef22a8883408193fc9bfd052f38cc_b02-el-metro.mp3?Expires=1794099612&Signature=HMebVj03DkmeCkzQZWr9WzuQcUVeqJC2YnQbVcNe1GF4dRK1s0la45yRBzGpu-Vl4MRo3OgvlBYAQTHnUaOace10IasrW9waHyKG5vwsDD4Ew8ER4zO9YRWyAX2n9IZ70GSgwdBNAhrPpEA~GRx0TcmWNoEsar1Ai3KM-l3CEIrZiQa80pnGPo~1GL6LN0YdJaV53F-8kiEFnUqCXU5MUKbHIVGkkGQPUP4c4Put4tNpwoeypx2L6n3IkBtBazeSrXREgGemVCsqZvgTUTsQn2PC1R3WVNgoUFNqQW-Vx~afNeSLgT6wzqEsS0XAGtvBm9HoWmJByQIGLb0Y9i-e~w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "60be9ee5-bc7b-4771-95a3-0f278a7799a7",
      "title": "Leia a observação curta e ligue a palavra a uma situação real da cidade.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "26cf0c74-e687-49df-8822-17b672c41fce",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>el metro</strong> costuma aparecer quando o deslocamento acontece dentro da cidade e o caminho precisa ser rápido.</p><p>Ele funciona bem para falar de trajetos entre bairros e pelo centro sem entrar em muitos detalhes da rota.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f8f9f0fc-6e55-4a28-8c60-0c7314631b3f",
      "title": "Olhe a imagem, escute o áudio e observe a palavra em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "b15a0c74-7807-4d37-8f18-bc349f1d7a90",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe, escute e leia.</p><p><strong>el autobús</strong></p><p>Em português: o ônibus.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/98eb0ef612894a1ba776a10e54edacd1_b04-el-autobus.png?Expires=1794099612&Signature=sZgva-~3wTZE1j3ClAMmHWj5i0PIEOjPCyCJsc8vrMMJnsH~7qa2Q284iHkhKcHyjHwC~z-kVhXf9pEUejq-ooRp0Z92qyDdCsaVUaluFm7kzPwbWDXtSGUv3F5OVjoi-5Gf9Ukml5Gz4VchhpGgRyI56Oh5Y7VMjzBLGKtbXTrgcIBZbvCFlACFrzRlTUlOe0EENzCpnGqjnjMioIiZdAbBW5TG9qEUd5a6jQFpQQjPWqc39eVx9fbw1wnMz82eCvH20F-W2KtIZggZAbjycUnO6xHI7fUyaRs1B7JPKlRD7UxsrdDI9SLQcJqDctoH7k4WpgAUNHiihh4UQrxjDA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c16d982eecbf417b9a2a7c58e18c1dc9_b04-el-autobus.mp3?Expires=1794099612&Signature=Ec5Wo4tD4FrFG5Qf6v2R8GmPutHizc48hNR65UMz8Mo0f6Bm3TrNvoWDiSWLJ738An7-w6Y2vZzIVhY-BN~cu9HfS1pvQg4grlXETRa0sfOSpux~ntLwPz~-KKCESjpR928o9ojnLaVhBiZ0eYgFhMwwTT5MjCWH1fzxGw3J4SVyIzpheZz6UisNmADp4roRjsGZ9-Kz3MF7eqkJoq~Od3rVF8uHC7p66GqcNm4PIXSFVehE3vhogzvuopj-ZrHQ92nEx0blQionDxrEAa-GRUFOsDLaIKRQts24GBlEDFpbnfiRhOjocRyis3to9IKqyuRDtsMXdDX-nhi8gufYrQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
